2026-10-02T00:00:02Z (RFD66606-2292) '`RFD.RECTGTN`, the `steps` block in `RFD.DSL`, `mix rfd.rectgtn`, `rectgtn/organization.ex`, `rectgtn/problems/`, and `scripts/check_rectgtn_plan.exs`
 # tags: rfd:scope, rfd:no-final-newline
 Text:RFD2292  1 LINE
