2026-10-02T00:00:04Z (RFD66606-2292) 'RFD66606-2287 states its critical path as eight numbered paragraphs.
 # tags: rfd:intrigue
 Text:RFD2292  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-02T00:00:05Z (RFD66606-2292) 'Run `elixir scripts/check_rectgtn_plan.exs` to hold each solution against the planner.
 # tags: rfd:exit
 Text:RFD2292  1 LINE
